I decided for qt since it has a very nice API and gui designer. 
The file MainWindow.py is automatically generated using the command

  pyuic5 MainWindow.ui -o MainWindow.py

To edit the gui use

  designer MainWindow.ui

Runtime dependencies are PyQt5, PyOpenGL, and system GLU/GLUT libraries.
Meson generates the Python forms and resources during the build when pyuic5
and pyrcc5 are available. Use -Dgui=enabled to require GUI support.

See doc/gui_audit.rst for the workflow checklist and regression-test command.
